# File: scripts/__tests__/sdlc-status.test.mjs, scripts/__tests__/sdlc-execute.test.mjs
# Generated from: specs/458-fix-sdlc-status-pull-request-query-failing-on-unsupported-reviewthreads-field/requirements.md
Feature: Fix sdlc-status pull-request query failing on unsupported reviewThreads field

  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: Status reports the branch's open draft pull request
    Given issue branch "42-example" whose open draft pull request 9 is returned by "gh pr view"
    And a "gh" stub that rejects any "pr view --json" field outside the gh 2.97.0 field set with "Unknown JSON field"
    When "/sdlc-status --json" collects evidence for that branch
    Then "pullRequest" has number 9, state "OPEN", isDraft true, the branch head as "headRefOid", "baseRefName" "main", "mergeStateStatus" "CLEAN", and closing issue numbers [42]
    And "missingArtifacts" does not contain "pull request"

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: Execute verify observes the draft pull request
    Given issue branch "42-example" at head H whose verification report is a current Pass with readiness "pr_evidence_satisfied"
    And its open draft pull request has head H
    And a "gh" stub that rejects unsupported "pr view --json" fields
    When the "/sdlc-execute" controller evaluates the verify result for issue 42
    Then it treats verification as green and dispatches deliver instead of reporting "pr_evidence_pending"

  @SCN003 @regression
  Scenario: A failed pull-request query is reported as a gap
    Given "gh pr view" exits 1 with "HTTP 502: Bad Gateway", exits 1 with a 409-character error, or exits 0 with output that is not valid JSON
    When status evidence is collected
    Then "pullRequest" is null
    And "gaps" contains exactly one pull-request entry: "pull request fetch failed: " with the bounded error message for a command failure, or "pull request parse failed: " with the bounded parse error for invalid JSON

  @SCN004 @regression
  Scenario: A branch without a pull request is unchanged
    Given "gh pr view" exits 1 with 'no pull requests found for branch "42-example"'
    And the verification report is a current Pass
    When status evidence is collected
    Then "pullRequest" is null and "gaps" contains no pull-request entry
    And status reports stage "verified" with next action "/sdlc-open-pr #42"
